      "created_at": "2013-01-05T04:35:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just thought I'd share this with you all. I know GTG had some con-exclusive Sentinels button set, which was great and I thought was neat. But it wasn't enough for me.</p><p>So I had my own made, with some extras!</p><p>These are the first 11 in a set of what I'm planning on being a set of buttons for every hero! And maybe some villains. I would have made Chrono-Ranger (because he's so cool), but his character art has only been posted with the text surrounding it, so it wouldn't have worked. I'll just have to wait until they post his character card art with just the art and no card text.</p><p>The best part? This whole set of 1.25' buttons was $18.19 from Zazzle.com. That includes shipping. What a deal, right?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/07bea0a2a5374b5eb4e65a81c504ebd5f7ce4aa8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/07bea0a2a5374b5eb4e65a81c504ebd5f7ce4aa8\" title=\"buttons.jpg\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/07bea0a2a5374b5eb4e65a81c504ebd5f7ce4aa8_2_669x500.jpeg\" alt=\"buttons.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"16vL6D33Q9B7DtwYudtyGBhmxRe\" width=\"669\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/07bea0a2a5374b5eb4e65a81c504ebd5f7ce4aa8_2_669x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/07bea0a2a5374b5eb4e65a81c504ebd5f7ce4aa8.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/07bea0a2a5374b5eb4e65a81c504ebd5f7ce4aa8.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/07bea0a2a5374b5eb4e65a81c504ebd5f7ce4aa8_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">buttons.jpg</span><span